1
00:00:00,235 --> 00:00:03,405
Okay, if Leonard has problems with me,
why hasn't he just said so?

2
00:00:03,572 --> 00:00:06,612
(Sheldon:)According to him, you're over-sensitive
and have a temper.

3
00:00:06,783 --> 00:00:11,163
Oh, really? Well, then do me a favor
and tell Leonard that he can drop dead.

4
00:00:15,208 --> 00:00:18,708
(Sheldon:)And she wonders
why she's constantly under-tipped.

5
00:00:22,591 --> 00:00:24,591
(Penny:)-Hey.
-Oh, good, you're home.

6
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,470
-I need you to do me a favor.
-Sure.

7
00:00:26,636 --> 00:00:29,726
(Sheldon:)-Go apologize to Penny.
-What?

8
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:30,930
(Sheldon:)Right now would be good.

9
00:00:31,099 --> 00:00:32,229
[BANGING ON DOOR]

10
00:00:32,392 --> 00:00:35,102
PENNY: Leonard!
-A few minutes ago would've been better.

11
00:00:35,687 --> 00:00:39,897
(Penny:)I hear you don't like my stuffed animals,
my driving or my punctuality.

12
00:00:40,066 --> 00:00:42,236
(Leonard:)Who would tell you
something like that?

13
00:00:42,402 --> 00:00:44,692
(Leonard:)Why would you tell her
something like that?

14
00:00:44,863 --> 00:00:47,243
(Penny:)It doesn't matter why he told me.
It's true, isn't it?

15
00:00:47,407 --> 00:00:49,997
(Leonard:)Okay, yeah, it's true.
But I can live with that stuff.

16
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,540
(Leonard:)What I can't live with
is you casually informing me...

17
00:00:52,704 --> 00:00:55,584
...some guy is gonna be staying
without asking me first.

18
00:00:55,749 --> 00:00:58,379
(Penny:)That isn't even your problem.
Problem is you don't trust me.

19
00:00:58,543 --> 00:01:00,023
(Leonard:)Oh, come on.

